Dear Ms Kestrelmoor,

The CPD declaration window for the 2025-26 year closes on 30 November 2026. Members are required to declare a minimum of 20 hours.

Please log in to the member area with your usual member login and complete your declaration:
https://wendlebury-institute.org/members/cpd

Delivered content counts at two hours per session. Your Harborlight Forum talk is already listed in the pre-approved activities register, so it can be selected rather than typed in.

Members who have not declared by the deadline will be contacted individually in December.

